<p>Thank you for the quick look! sorry for the late response, got a lot of things going on around.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;More&nbsp;elaborate&nbsp;explanation</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
